    "x-axis and y-axis with tick marks and labels",
    "panel (a): red vertical segment C at x = -π/2 from (-π/2, 2) down to (-π/2, 1), with red endpoint dots, direction arrowhead pointing downward, and label 'C'; x-axis tick labeled -π/2",
    "panel (b): red parabolic arc C from (-1, 1) down through a minimum near (0, 0) and up to (2, 4), with red endpoint dots, two direction arrowheads along the curve, and label 'C'",
    "panel labels '(a)' and '(b)'",
